;
; How Weatherglass caches one reading in MYRA (weatherglass_model.h WG4),
; so the last forecast shows offline: when it is for (seconds since 1970),
; the air temperature in tenths of a degree Celsius, the wind in tenths of
; a metre a second and the rain of the hour in tenths of a millimetre.
; Weatherglass asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXWEATHER(stamp:i11) = temp:i4! ^ wind:i4! ^ rain:i5!
